   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **stage entrance**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **The Animator**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **Birds of Paradise**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Holding On**: rare: 13 archived performances [2]\n- **In Chains**: rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n- **Look Out for My Love**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Accidentally Like a Martyr**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **It's Your Destiny**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **twod2019-12-29** (recommended): audience recording; 18 songs; 118 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- First night of a special holiday concert series featuring guest Adam Granduciel [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **twod2019-12-29**: taped by larryrulz; transferred by larryrulz; source: master audience recording [1]. Also: Recorded with Sound Pro AT943 mics into a Sony M10 recorder; Audio processed in Audacity, transferred to TLH, and tagged in foobar2000 [1]",
